R-NI3 R-SP16 R-SP17 R-SP25 R-SP24 R-NM8 R-NM3 R-NR2 R-EC13 R-WS12 R-LD4 (slice 017): the prompt R-NI3 in interactive mode (stdin and stderr are a terminal), with the fake Fx. Workspace `ws`: member a holds json 2.0.0, member b has no json, and `tln add acme/json@2.2.0 --file ws/apps/b/main.roc` needs the move of the json of a (as run 1 of `moves/hm1-noninteractive`).
Run 1: the person presses Enter. The default of the prompt is No (R-NM8), so Talon writes nothing and stops with exit 13 (R-EC13). The report is the same as in non-interactive mode (R-NM3). The prompt comes after the 6 probes of the ladder and before the second read of the files (R-SP16: the last step before the write).
Run 2: the person types `y`: both members are written. The prompt is asked once in each run.
